Decisions made in Washington that are hurting people in our own state who are struggling already.
华盛顿做出的决定正在伤害我们州已经陷入困境的人们。

46
00:02:48,230 --> 00:02:51,950
Farmers, businesses, ranchers, every Kansan hurt by the tariffs.
农民、企业、牧场主，每个堪萨斯人都受到关税的伤害。

