00:03:26,200 --> 00:03:28,880
The government made to people who are struggling.
政府为那些陷入困境的人们做出了贡献。

57
00:03:29,260 --> 00:03:29,880
That's not okay.
那不行。

58
00:03:29,960 --> 00:03:31,580
That's not who we are in Kansas.
那不是我们堪萨斯州的人。

59
00:03:32,080 --> 00:03:33,180
But I want to say a few other things.
但我还想说几句话。

