118
00:06:46,870 --> 00:06:48,750
Those children just just stayed there at school.
那些孩子只是呆在学校里。

119
00:06:49,130 --> 00:06:50,050
This was not okay.
这不行。

120
00:06:50,357 --> 00:06:52,921
And nine These were all Republicans telling me this.
